OOZIE-2214 fix test case
 TestCoordRerunXCommand.testCoordRerunDateNeg (ryota)

Here is the root cause:
The bug was likely caused by the conditional handling of exceptions in `CoordUtils.java`, where the code only threw a `CommandException` for errors other than `E0605`. This could lead to situations where certain errors were not properly propagated, causing the test case `TestCoordRerunXCommand.testCoordRerunDateNeg` to fail due to unhandled exceptions or incorrect logging behavior.

